<aside class="guide-maintenance" aria-label="Guide scope and maintenance">
  <h2>Scope and keeping this guide current</h2>
  <p>This pilot covers Macon-Bibb research questions using selected public records, not every agency, official, meeting or election. A missing record does not establish that no record or event exists.</p>
  <p>Official linking pages reviewed <time datetime={BIBB_TOPIC_LINK_REVIEW}>November 1, 2026</time>. This is a review of resource links, not verification of every record or a promise that an official page has not changed. Record dates are shown with the entries; they may be past or future.</p>
  <p>The editor publishing a guide change is responsible for reviewing its sources and dated guidance. Review is required before publishing a correction and when official notices change; a successful site publication updates the guide. Check original sources for current instructions.</p>
  <p><a href="/docs/admins/#civic-topic-guide-maintenance">Editorial maintenance process</a> · <a href="/about/">About Civic Pulse and its independence</a></p>
</aside>
